WEBVTT

00:00:05.831 --> 00:00:09.201
That such an accident as this
may never happen again,

00:00:09.201 --> 00:00:14.840
we ingrain the significance of
these victims deeply into our hearts,

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:21.546
- and must endeavor never to forget them.
- Mom... Ai...

00:00:21.546 --> 00:00:23.377
Dad...

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:27.719
"Reserved for the bereaved family"

00:00:27.719 --> 00:00:28.520
"Reserved for the bereaved family"
Is all of this... Dad's fault?

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:32.047
Is all of this... Dad's fault?

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:43.668
What is this?

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:46.034
Why would I do that?

00:00:56.248 --> 00:00:58.409
I...

00:01:14.165 --> 00:01:19.871
Osanai hi ni nakushita

00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:25.744
sono itami no imi sae

00:01:25.744 --> 00:01:31.516
Uzumakumatte takushita

00:01:31.516 --> 00:01:34.713
Boku wa kitto...

00:01:36.087 --> 00:01:42.427
Ao no hate ni mita yokan wo toraete

00:01:42.427 --> 00:01:49.935
kaze ni nori hikari no sasu hou e

00:01:49.935 --> 00:01:52.804
I'll always be with you

00:01:52.804 --> 00:01:55.440
see the sky in front of you

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:59.809
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:02:01.546 --> 00:02:06.985
Uzumaku hoshi no hibiki ni nosete

00:02:06.985 --> 00:02:09.654
utau yo

00:02:09.654 --> 00:02:18.323
Kono koe ga kimi ni todokimasu you ni

00:02:36.648 --> 00:02:38.411
Otohime?

00:02:42.287 --> 00:02:44.084
What is that?

00:02:49.194 --> 00:02:51.629
Target body confirmed as being unrecorded.

00:02:51.629 --> 00:02:54.699
It's the Neo-Original that attacked L-3 Base.

00:02:54.699 --> 00:02:59.830
From Lagrange-3 to the Earth's
surface in just 267 seconds?!

00:03:01.706 --> 00:03:04.971
Target sighted. Moving in.

00:03:11.549 --> 00:03:13.278
It's huge...

00:03:16.955 --> 00:03:19.287
Here it comes, Howling Star.

00:03:31.669 --> 00:03:34.638
It's gone! It can't be!

00:03:38.043 --> 00:03:40.045
It disappeared?

00:03:40.045 --> 00:03:42.206
What's going on here?

00:04:02.434 --> 00:04:05.170
What is this?

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:09.274
What is all this?

00:04:09.274 --> 00:04:13.445
We'll have a hearing regarding
the Album incident later.

00:04:13.445 --> 00:04:15.747
You stay there and keep
watch on Gio and Widow

00:04:15.747 --> 00:04:18.550
until you receive further instructions.

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:21.219
I'm concerned that those
two might start rampaging.

00:04:21.219 --> 00:04:25.690
Keep watch? But the Album...

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:26.958
We have to get the Album back!

00:04:26.958 --> 00:04:32.263
Listen to me, I'll say it again.
There is no need for you to return here.

00:04:32.263 --> 00:04:36.301
Consider it a makeshift house arrest.
Wait there for instructions.

00:04:36.301 --> 00:04:39.202
Please wait, Professor! I'm still...

00:04:40.605 --> 00:04:44.876
If anything, you're safer there.

00:04:44.876 --> 00:04:48.073
Both you, and the children.

00:04:56.754 --> 00:04:57.889
Hey!

00:04:57.889 --> 00:04:59.891
Let me out of here!

00:04:59.891 --> 00:05:02.382
I'm going to go help Toa!

00:05:07.065 --> 00:05:08.794
It won't work.

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:15.073
It is impossible for you
to Actualize in this space,

00:05:15.073 --> 00:05:18.109
under the effects of CSS.

00:05:18.109 --> 00:05:20.812
What do you plan to do with us?

00:05:20.812 --> 00:05:22.614
Nothing at all.

00:05:22.614 --> 00:05:26.518
You're just going to stay here
and behave yourselves.

00:05:26.518 --> 00:05:29.851
Behave ourselves?

00:05:41.533 --> 00:05:45.970
In their state, nothing would
happen if they did start rampaging.

00:05:50.708 --> 00:05:52.610
It's strange.

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:55.980
Neither one of them is
showing signs of rampaging.

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:58.380
Why would the professor say what he did?

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:07.058
Is he hiding something from me?

00:06:07.058 --> 00:06:12.130
As of now, we will be referring
to the Neo-Original as the Ostrum.

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:17.835
What a thing to happen, as D Project
is about to move into Phase 7.

00:06:17.835 --> 00:06:23.174
The Ostrum destroyed L-3 Base,
and brought down Otohime.

00:06:23.174 --> 00:06:26.411
Unlike the Album, it is clearly hostile.

00:06:26.411 --> 00:06:31.583
But why did it disappear?
Professor Nozaki, what is its objective?

00:06:31.583 --> 00:06:35.520
It did not disappear. Look here.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:39.424
This is the moment the Ostrum vanished.

00:06:39.424 --> 00:06:41.326
Here.

00:06:41.326 --> 00:06:44.529
At this moment,
a spatial distortion appears.

00:06:44.529 --> 00:06:47.865
It's highly possible that a large body
moved into an alternate space.

00:06:47.865 --> 00:06:54.005
In other words, the Ostrum
became a Communicator.

00:06:54.005 --> 00:06:57.408
- What?!
- That can't be! For what purpose?!

00:06:57.408 --> 00:07:00.111
Who and when did it go through
Resonance with in the first place?!

00:07:00.111 --> 00:07:01.846
I don't know the reason why.

00:07:01.846 --> 00:07:06.551
But in light of the case of
the Album and Kamishina Jin,

00:07:06.551 --> 00:07:11.356
an Original type is not bound
by the orders of a Master.

00:07:11.356 --> 00:07:15.193
Such an unfettered Dragon
has now taken human form.

00:07:15.193 --> 00:07:18.730
You'd be right to call this
a worst-case scenario.

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:22.734
I propose we conduct a general
evacuation of all residents.

00:07:22.734 --> 00:07:26.137
That's crazy! Just how many people
do you think we're talking about?!

00:07:26.137 --> 00:07:30.608
When looking for gold dust,
you have to sift through all of the sand,

00:07:30.608 --> 00:07:31.909
is that what you're saying?

00:07:31.909 --> 00:07:34.545
Yes. Whatever remains

00:07:34.545 --> 00:07:37.275
is the enemy.

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:41.719
This is the ISDA Safety Office.

00:07:41.719 --> 00:07:45.490
An evacuation advisory has
been issued for the entire island.

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:47.625
Following a check on
your Resident ID number

00:07:47.625 --> 00:07:49.560
at the nearest evacuation center,

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:52.830
please proceed to board your
designated ship or aircraft.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:57.235
This is next to insane.
We don't have enough leads.

00:07:57.235 --> 00:08:00.805
What does that guy
mean by hiding, anyway?

00:08:00.805 --> 00:08:03.074
Are we searching the whole place?

00:08:03.074 --> 00:08:08.079
Nonetheless, we can't very well
just wait for him to use his ability.

00:08:08.079 --> 00:08:10.448
I do realize that, you know.

00:08:10.448 --> 00:08:14.652
Kazuki, you take care of
conducting the residents to evacuate.

00:08:14.652 --> 00:08:17.018
Work together with the special forces unit.

00:08:18.356 --> 00:08:21.426
Roger.

00:08:21.426 --> 00:08:27.332
Why... should I have to
crawl along the ground?

00:08:27.332 --> 00:08:29.095
Why?!

00:08:36.374 --> 00:08:38.343
Nothing.

00:08:38.343 --> 00:08:43.181
I don't hear anything.
I don't sense Toa at all.

00:08:43.181 --> 00:08:46.684
Does that mean she's not here anymore?

00:08:46.684 --> 00:08:48.447
I don't know.

00:08:51.656 --> 00:08:55.393
- Listen...
- Toa has some sort of objective.

00:08:55.393 --> 00:08:58.830
I'm sure of that. But...

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:01.566
No sooner does she allow herself
to be caught, than suddenly,

00:09:01.566 --> 00:09:06.704
she runs off somewhere else.
It doesn't make much sense, huh?

00:09:06.704 --> 00:09:13.144
I don't know anything about Toa.
She never told me about herself.

00:09:13.144 --> 00:09:17.248
That's why I want to see her, and make sure.

00:09:17.248 --> 00:09:18.983
Akira-chan!

00:09:18.983 --> 00:09:21.753
A fourth Original Dragon has appeared.

00:09:21.753 --> 00:09:23.354
What?!

00:09:23.354 --> 00:09:26.391
Original? Like Toa?

00:09:26.391 --> 00:09:29.160
This is the ISDA Safety Office.

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:31.651
An evacuation advisory has been issued...

00:09:33.564 --> 00:09:35.700
This is search party team 21,

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:39.604
currently searching
underground corridor E-46.

00:09:39.604 --> 00:09:43.841
We still haven't sighted any suspects.

00:09:43.841 --> 00:09:45.777
Wait, just a moment, please.

00:09:45.777 --> 00:09:50.448
You there, what are you doing down here?

00:09:50.448 --> 00:09:53.217
- Why didn't you go to your evacuation center?
- We've discovered one suspect.

00:09:53.217 --> 00:09:55.686
Would you show me some ID?

00:09:55.686 --> 00:09:57.449
You there!

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:06.297
Picking up a pulse from
Sector 6 of Shin City!

00:10:06.297 --> 00:10:07.632
It's the Ostrum!

00:10:07.632 --> 00:10:09.801
Send in Raina and Sigelinde!

00:10:09.801 --> 00:10:11.402
We've got fires in that same sector!

00:10:11.402 --> 00:10:13.271
Target has started moving!

00:10:13.271 --> 00:10:15.740
It's headed toward a
nearby evacuation center!

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:19.310
They still haven't finished
loading people onto buses

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:20.878
to take them to the airport!

00:10:20.878 --> 00:10:23.369
Hurry, Howling Star!

00:10:30.221 --> 00:10:33.884
At a time like this, why me?!

00:10:35.493 --> 00:10:39.827
Then again, I don't dislike that attitude.

00:10:40.932 --> 00:10:42.661
I get it.

00:10:48.673 --> 00:10:51.609
Just you wait!

00:10:51.609 --> 00:10:55.313
Please remain calm! Do not panic,
and get aboard the buses!

00:10:55.313 --> 00:10:57.804
We'll reach the airport soon!

00:11:28.145 --> 00:11:33.117
You... are going to change us...

00:11:33.117 --> 00:11:34.880
If that's the case...

00:11:40.391 --> 00:11:43.160
Reading an explosion in Shin Sector 7!

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.889
Putting it on the monitor.

00:11:46.831 --> 00:11:49.197
W-What is this?

00:12:10.054 --> 00:12:12.657
What's that over there?

00:12:12.657 --> 00:12:14.921
What on earth is going on?

00:12:20.164 --> 00:12:23.100
We didn't make it in time!

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:25.536
Sigelinde, here he comes!

00:12:25.536 --> 00:12:28.039
Why, you! Amadeus!

00:12:28.039 --> 00:12:29.407
Wait!

00:12:29.407 --> 00:12:31.204
Right there!

00:12:48.192 --> 00:12:49.887
He's fast.

00:12:53.064 --> 00:12:55.299
That's the fourth Original?

00:12:55.299 --> 00:12:58.427
Is he responsible for
that explosion earlier, too?

00:13:14.652 --> 00:13:16.621
Akira-chan...

00:13:16.621 --> 00:13:19.215
Machina, you see right through me, huh?

00:13:22.493 --> 00:13:26.397
I'm hopeless, aren't I?
I can't keep things separate.

00:13:26.397 --> 00:13:29.133
I'm not even a Dragonaut anymore,

00:13:29.133 --> 00:13:30.901
but I can't leave them alone.

00:13:30.901 --> 00:13:32.603
Akira...

00:13:32.603 --> 00:13:35.673
Now then, let's go, Machina.

00:13:35.673 --> 00:13:37.742
Mm-hmm, Akira-chan.

00:13:37.742 --> 00:13:39.443
Akira!

00:13:39.443 --> 00:13:41.779
Um...

00:13:41.779 --> 00:13:44.270
...thanks for everything.

00:13:45.683 --> 00:13:48.152
Sure.

00:13:48.152 --> 00:13:52.189
Jin, you make sure
to find Toa, now, got it?

00:13:52.189 --> 00:13:56.990
Gio is being isolated on
Tartarus. Go to him, quickly.

00:14:10.675 --> 00:14:12.802
Let's go, Machina!

00:14:17.214 --> 00:14:19.684
- You!
- Yo!

00:14:19.684 --> 00:14:23.017
I'm here to offer you a lifeboat.

00:14:32.129 --> 00:14:33.960
You're mine!

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:39.036
It didn't work?!

00:14:39.036 --> 00:14:41.027
The ground is melting from his heat!

00:14:46.243 --> 00:14:48.212
Sigelinde!

00:14:48.212 --> 00:14:49.873
What?!

00:14:54.518 --> 00:14:58.181
W-Water? It couldn't be!

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:02.593
Machina!

00:15:02.593 --> 00:15:04.754
Here goes!

00:15:12.203 --> 00:15:15.272
See that?! "Like water on a hot stone!"

00:15:15.272 --> 00:15:18.109
That doesn't mean what you think it does.

00:15:18.109 --> 00:15:20.344
What are you doing here now?

00:15:20.344 --> 00:15:22.413
What do you mean? I came to help you.

00:15:22.413 --> 00:15:25.249
I never asked you to.

00:15:25.249 --> 00:15:27.551
Charmless, aren't you?

00:15:27.551 --> 00:15:29.246
Dummy!

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:40.030
So, who exactly are you?

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:43.100
Hm? Just a reporter.

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:46.592
Why are you helping me out?

00:15:48.205 --> 00:15:51.697
It's for someone important to me.

00:16:00.618 --> 00:16:02.953
Was that?

00:16:02.953 --> 00:16:06.889
Hey! Don't be in such
a rush that you get hurt!

00:16:25.009 --> 00:16:27.244
Gio!

00:16:27.244 --> 00:16:28.913
Jin!

00:16:28.913 --> 00:16:31.515
I won't let you have Gio!

00:16:31.515 --> 00:16:35.686
Gio belongs to me! I made him!

00:16:35.686 --> 00:16:39.122
Gio is not a thing!

00:16:43.594 --> 00:16:45.095
Jin!

00:16:45.095 --> 00:16:48.799
- Jin!
- Gio!

00:16:48.799 --> 00:16:50.494
Gio!!

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:57.470
"Unlock"

00:16:57.942 --> 00:17:00.711
Gio! Are you all right?!

00:17:00.711 --> 00:17:02.546
Toa...

00:17:02.546 --> 00:17:06.350
Toa was taken away by the Girouard Force!

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:08.045
What?!

00:17:11.222 --> 00:17:14.658
All right, Jin... all right...

00:17:14.658 --> 00:17:20.631
You and Gio are both turning
against me, no matter what I do.

00:17:20.631 --> 00:17:22.531
In that case...

00:17:23.667 --> 00:17:26.534
See you in hell!!

00:17:30.541 --> 00:17:32.236
Jin!

00:17:40.584 --> 00:17:43.018
It's no use! We can't stop him!

00:17:52.329 --> 00:17:54.932
Communication with the
Lindworm Unit has been cut off!

00:17:54.932 --> 00:17:57.059
The Ostrum is incoming!

00:18:00.771 --> 00:18:02.940
The Ostrum is directly over the base!

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:04.708
Commander, unless we do something...

00:18:04.708 --> 00:18:08.612
Shift the Avenir timetable by 495 hours,

00:18:08.612 --> 00:18:11.081
and move to Phase 7 as of right now!

00:18:11.081 --> 00:18:15.052
But the assembly is
only 32 percent finished!

00:18:15.052 --> 00:18:16.787
No matter! Hurry!

00:18:16.787 --> 00:18:18.687
A-Acknowledged!

00:18:22.026 --> 00:18:26.063
As of this moment,
this base is moving to Phase 7.

00:18:26.063 --> 00:18:30.067
- All personnel, to your stations.
Repeat, as of this moment,
- Now you've done it, Dragon.

00:18:30.067 --> 00:18:33.628
This base is moving to Phase 7.

00:18:51.555 --> 00:18:54.058
Professor!

00:18:54.058 --> 00:18:56.060
So you've come, have you?

00:18:56.060 --> 00:19:01.999
Why didn't you tell me that a
fourth Original had appeared?

00:19:01.999 --> 00:19:08.472
She has done so well.
She can go to sleep now.

00:19:08.472 --> 00:19:11.976
She? You mean the Raum?

00:19:11.976 --> 00:19:16.647
It's not like you to talk
that way about a sample.

00:19:16.647 --> 00:19:19.316
It's not like me, huh?

00:19:19.316 --> 00:19:22.286
Professor, what are you... Professor!

00:19:22.286 --> 00:19:25.489
Please stop!

00:19:25.489 --> 00:19:31.095
Why?! How could you?!

00:19:31.095 --> 00:19:39.103
Why do you take everything
from me, both you and Nanami?

00:19:39.103 --> 00:19:41.638
You don't need to rely on such things.

00:19:41.638 --> 00:19:46.343
Why?! Are you that averse
to me accomplishing anything?!

00:19:46.343 --> 00:19:52.942
You were my ideal...
my model scientist! That's why I...

00:19:57.788 --> 00:20:00.018
W-What?

00:20:02.292 --> 00:20:03.987
He's here.

00:20:14.738 --> 00:20:17.908
Gio, this is the end.

00:20:17.908 --> 00:20:21.345
Let him go.

00:20:21.345 --> 00:20:25.849
I see. You prefer him that much, do you?

00:20:25.849 --> 00:20:27.718
Then...

00:20:27.718 --> 00:20:30.687
...I don't need you anymore!

00:20:35.993 --> 00:20:40.497
Why are you allied with the humans?

00:20:40.497 --> 00:20:44.401
Because that is my will.

00:20:44.401 --> 00:20:47.097
Your will, you say?

00:20:48.439 --> 00:20:51.840
Your will, you say?!

00:21:05.722 --> 00:21:07.917
W-What?!

00:21:48.932 --> 00:21:51.901
The Atrum...

00:22:07.451 --> 00:22:14.124
Me to me ga atta shunkan

00:22:14.124 --> 00:22:20.931
kanashimi ga hajimaru ki ga shita

00:22:20.931 --> 00:22:27.604
Keshite mo kienai kioku ima demo

00:22:27.604 --> 00:22:34.806
futari no kokoro tsunaide'ru

00:22:36.647 --> 00:22:43.487
Ikusen no hoshi no kazu hodo hito wa

00:22:43.487 --> 00:22:46.490
afurete iru no ni ne

00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:50.360
kimi shika mienai

00:22:50.360 --> 00:22:53.530
Aenakute mo

00:22:53.530 --> 00:22:56.466
kanawanakute mo

00:22:56.466 --> 00:23:02.739
tsunoru omoi wa kitto eien

00:23:02.739 --> 00:23:09.746
Unmei ga futari wo hikisaku nara

00:23:09.746 --> 00:23:16.587
deaeta koto dake wo kiseki to shinjite

00:23:16.587 --> 00:23:23.193
Hora nagarete'ku kono ame no you

00:23:23.193 --> 00:23:29.233
Itoshisa dake wo kimi ni furasetai

00:23:29.233 --> 00:23:33.431
Rain of Love

00:23:42.713 --> 00:23:46.783
Up, up, down, L, R, B, A...

00:23:46.783 --> 00:23:48.952
Megumi, what are you doing?

00:23:48.952 --> 00:23:51.021
- The all-powerful command.
- What's that?

00:23:51.021 --> 00:23:54.858
It gives you all weapons! I'll be able
to handle any enemy easily now.

00:23:54.858 --> 00:23:56.627
Even that huge Dragon!

00:23:56.627 --> 00:23:58.228
U-Uh...

00:23:58.228 --> 00:24:01.131
It gives me the all-powerful bombs and stuff!

00:24:01.131 --> 00:24:03.467
This is hopeless, let's leave her alone.

00:24:03.467 --> 00:24:04.701
Yeah.

00:24:04.701 --> 00:24:06.436
Next time, will this finally be settled?

00:24:06.436 --> 00:24:09.462
Er, Megumi, you're still on Level 1, aren't you?
